@startuml
title Target — Interaction overview for capture-to-detection workflow
start
:ESP32 sends image and capture metadata;
:API authenticates ingestion client\nand validates metadata;
if (Request accepted?) then (yes)
  :Validate deployment and capture time;
  :Save image to private object storage;
  :Publish captures.raw message;
  :Return 202 Accepted to ESP32;
  :AI worker consumes with bounded prefetch;
  if (Image valid and inference succeeds?) then (yes)
    :Load image and run inference;
    :Publish detections.classified message;
    :Acknowledge captures.raw message;
    :Backend consumes the classified result;
    :Backend validates and persists Detection;
    :Acknowledge classified message;
  else (no)
    :Retry transient processing failures;
    if (Retry limit exceeded?) then (yes)
      :Route message to captures.dlq;
    endif
  endif
else (no)
  :Return authentication or validation error;
endif
stop

note right
  Planned workflow from docs/domain-model.md,
  docs/api-contract.md, and docs/architecture.md.
  Exact retry policy and storage provider are undecided.
end note
@enduml
